      "content": "i know people want to help but it feels like they're just helping a version of me that isn't even there anymore. it's like the social part of me died. if everyone's already moved on and forgotten i'm even here, then what's the point of trying to force it? it just feels so empty. like i'm just going through the motions of a life that's already finished.",
